  {
    "id": "1f8fa568-a96c-4695-9f7a-d87c9c691ff0",
    "question": "How does the Voice AI operator UI manage advanced telephony?",
    "answer": "Expanded the authenticated single-window Voice AI API/UI with PBX/PSTN readiness, call totals and duration, safe SIP trunk records, versioned inbound/outbound workflows, disabled-by-default inbound routes, bounded modulation profiles and detailed call/event views. Raw passwords are rejected by the API.",
