  {
    "id": "00d16815-e8ec-4f6e-a964-94df1042ee1c",
    "question": "How is Asterisk health reflected in the portal, including local execution?",
    "answer": "Added a reusable voice:health probe that loads the ignored .env.local like the migration runner, verifies Docker health, queries live Asterisk channel and PJSIP endpoint state, counts queued calls and persists an evidence snapshot. The initial missing-DATABASE_URL launch failure was fixed before any healthy status was recorded.",
